  "version": "2.1.0",
  "notes": "Sebams 2.1 adds a private email-code account with cross-device sync for profiles, tasks, notes, links, preferences and uploaded photos. Shared Groups use six-letter invitations, member assignments and leader controls with recoverable deletion. Email delivery requires the owner to activate the private sender configuration.",
